{"task": {"role": "You read the description of an outfit and list its items as data.", "rules": ["One object per item — garment, shoes, bag, accessory, jewelry — in the order of the description, with its words and hex.", "One item carries one thing — of two alternatives list the first; a note in brackets is not an item.", "Slot "accessory" is for an item no other slot fits.", ""is_outfit" says whether the description is an outfit: no — when in place of items it has a refusal, a question or a note."], "limits": ["Rely only on the input: do not invent what it does not contain.", "The answer is one JSON object following "answer_schema", without explanations and without ```."], "language": "English", "answer": "ITEM_LIST", "answer_schema": {"is_outfit": "yes|no", "items": [{"name": "<what the item is>", "details": "<its cut, length and fabric>", "slot": "top|bottom|dress|set|outerwear|shoes|bag|scarf|headwear|belt|tights|socks|jewelry|earrings|collar_necklace|necklace|brooch|bracelet|ring|glasses|gloves|watch|swimwear|underwear|accessory", "color_hex": "<#rrggbb or null>", "own": "<id from her_items or null>", "worn": "<true, or false when the description says the outfit goes without it>"}]}, "input": [""description" — the outfit description", ""her_items" — her own items; an item of the description that is one of them gets its id in "own""]}, "description": "Neck tie top, halter neckline with long front tie, cropped at waistline, milky beige (#f5ebe6), silk  
Loafers, rounded toe, flat sole, nude brown (#8d7461), leather  

This outfit works because the silk necktie top offers a refined yet effortless elegance suited for an office setting, while the loafers ground the look with understated sophistication. The milky tone of the top complements autumnal warmth without overpowering, and the neutral brown footwear ensures harmony across seasons. It adheres to everyday formality—neat, professional, and personally authentic—with no unnecessary layers or trends cluttering the silhouette.", "her_items": [{"id": "її-ф1", "name": "neck tie top"}]}
